The compiled data files under states/**/ (CSV and JSON) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The underlying records are public records of the agencies named in each
state's config.json (licensing rosters, Medicaid payment reports, enforcement
notices) and of the U.S. federal NPI registry. Source PDFs under
states/**/sources/ are reproduced as published by those agencies and remain
subject to whatever terms those agencies apply.
